  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Empowering the Youth of Malawi through Education and Skills (EYES of Malawi)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the Action aims at supporting secondary education and Technical, Entrepreneurial, and Vocational Education and Training (TEVET), through an integrated approach that links school feeding and social protection as critical enablers to break the cycle of low learning, early dropout, and limited livelihoods opportunities. School feeding will be institutionalised and scaled up as a cost-effective measure to keep children&#xbf;especially girls in all their diversity &#xbf;from ultra-poor households&#xbf;in school and to facilitate their transition to secondary education.</narrative>
  </description>
